01:31:13,328 --> 01:31:18,448
Lenny, hey man...I know you're bummed
about losing the game for us today

1694
01:31:18,449 --> 01:31:19,310
And you're drunk?

1695
01:31:19,311 --> 01:31:20,596
No!...Yes

1696
01:31:20,597 --> 01:31:24,970
Hey man, there's one thing
they'll never beat us at

1697
01:31:24,971 --> 01:31:27,135
What's this?

1698
01:31:27,136 --> 01:31:30,032
- Arrow roulette baby!
- Yeah, yeah

1699
01:31:30,033 --> 01:31:31,125
We are good at that

1700
01:31:31,125 --> 01:31:33,158
- All right everybody!
- What are you doing?

1701
01:31:33,159 --> 01:31:36,208
- Last one to stay in wins!
- No, no, no!!

1702
01:31:39,063 --> 01:31:40,980
Start running kids!

1703
01:31:44,911 --> 01:31:58,185
I hope tomorrow you'll find better things
I know tomorrow you'll find better things

1704
01:31:58,186 --> 01:32:03,997
I hope tomorrow you'll find better things
- A little help here, take me with you

1705
01:32:03,998 --> 01:32:05,973
Seriously?...you're going to leave me?

1706
01:32:06,163 --> 01:32:08,063
No...!

1707
01:32:08,064 --> 01:32:11,899
Ahh...! Haoww!!

1708
01:32:11,900 --> 01:32:14,489
We win again!
